>> hex := Sebopeho ncha: ['%x'].

# write 10
Sephetho ngola: Hx xA, mola-o-mocha.

# make it easy to write numbers as hex
Palo ha-ho-fihla: ['as-hex'] etsa: { <- hex sebelisa-ho-palo-e-felletseng: uena.
}.

# write
Sephetho ngola: Hx xA as-hex, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: Hx xFF as-hex, mola-o-mocha.